      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/19/business/bond-yields-treasury-department.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于财政部将可从投资者手中回购的债务数量增加一倍，政府债券收益率下跌，股市上涨。]]></description>
